# Angular Conventions

- Standalone components only — no NgModules
- `inject()` over constructor injection
- Signals: `signal()`, `computed()`, `input()`, `output()`, `effect()`
- `ChangeDetectionStrategy.OnPush` on all components
- Prefix: `app` (elements kebab-case, directives camelCase)

## Layer responsibilities

| Layer | Pattern |
|-------|---------|
| ui | Dumb — `input()`/`output()` only, no store/repository injection |
| pages | Smart — inject stores, compose ui components, handle routing |
| state | Signal stores with `inject()` for repositories and core services |
| webmcp | Tools inject state/domain, register via `provideXxxWebMcpTools()` |
| domain | Pure functions and types — no Angular decorators or Firebase |

## File placement checklist

1. New repository → `features/{name}/data-access/`
2. New store → `features/{name}/state/`
3. New agent tool → `features/{name}/webmcp/tools/{tool-name}/`
4. Cross-feature type → `core/domains/`, not another feature's domain
